<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ansett, Air NZ to codeshare on Tasman.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ansett, Air NZ to codeshare on Tasman.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Air Services Commission (IASC) said on Wednesday it would allow Ansett International to codeshare with its half-owner Air New Zealand on services between Australia and New Zealand.</p>
<p>The codeshare arrangement would take effect from February 1 and would initially cover services between Sydney-Auckland and Brisbane-Auckland, the IASC said in a statement.</p>
<p>The agreement may be extended to other routes at a later date, it said.</p>
<p>Ansett is owned 50/50 by News Corp Ltd and Air New Zealand. -- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
